-- [2] 프로젝트 도메인 특화: "사기" 또는 "편취" 문구가 들어간 요약문끼리만 좁혀서 탐색
--     (재산범죄 RAG 실사용 질의와 가장 가까운 시나리오)
SELECT
    a.chunk_id AS chunk_a,
    a.title    AS title_a,
    b.chunk_id AS chunk_b,
    b.title    AS title_b,
    ROUND(similarity(a.content, b.content)::numeric, 4) AS content_similarity
FROM legal_chunks a
JOIN legal_chunks b
  ON a.doc_type = 'prec'
 AND b.doc_type = 'prec'
 AND a.doc_id < b.doc_id
 AND a.chunk_id LIKE '%\_head\_1'
 AND b.chunk_id LIKE '%\_head\_1'
 AND (a.content LIKE '%사기%' OR a.content LIKE '%편취%')
 AND (b.content LIKE '%사기%' OR b.content LIKE '%편취%')
WHERE similarity(a.content, b.content) > 0.3
ORDER BY content_similarity DESC
LIMIT 40;

